### ---------------------------------------------
### 전체 거래 내역 조회
### ---------------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/api/v1/card/transactions
Accept: application/json

### ---------------------------------------------
### 특정 거래 조회 (ID로 조회)
### ---------------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/api/v1/card/transactions/1
Accept: application/json

### ---------------------------------------------
### 카드사별 거래 조회 (삼성카드)
### ---------------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/api/v1/card/transactions/by-company/SAMSUNG
Accept: application/json

### ---------------------------------------------
### 카드사별 거래 조회 (현대카드)
### ---------------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/api/v1/card/transactions/by-company/HYUNDAI
Accept: application/json

### ---------------------------------------------
### 파싱 실패 내역 조회
### ---------------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/api/v1/card/transactions/parse-failures
Accept: application/json

### ---------------------------------------------
### 거래 내역 조회 (거래일시순)
### ---------------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/api/v1/card/transactions/by-date
Accept: application/json

